            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/249a008e95b42fc398ad3a04eea48f62.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"What If the Girl Who Walked the Yellow-Brick Road Never Decided There&#039;s No Place Like Home?\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking in a mysterious town without any memories, you quickly find yourself embroiled in the war between several mafia famiglia and sheltered by the Oz famiglia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you attempt to find your place in this town, several handsome men vie for your attention.<br><br>Who will you choose to trust? To love? Can you find a place to call your own? Can you bring peace to the town?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/8a425407fabefe9c55ca669244b48105.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/cdda1aa481f2abdd2a03c236b69effc8.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Loads Of Handsome Men Based On Fairytale Characters\" width=780 height=277 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/1cb6e20ce08ed2a4ec6a8365fde3a623.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Oz Famiglia  Caramia - The Courageous Lion  Kyrie - The Cunning Scarecrow  Axel - The Tin Man With A Heart Of Gold\" width=776 height=978 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/27c06cefc95ff52a080e24f549bd5c87.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Grimm Famiglia  Hamelin - The Pied Piper of Chaos  Scarlet - The Peace-Seeking Little Red Riding Hood\" width=776 height=978 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/22c08c0fac2011fa51c1fcf29329debb.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"The Wolf Gang  Soh - The Patissier With a Secret  Caesar - The Big Bad Wolf With a Mission\" width=776 height=978 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/1757fc07c0c3097f2ed00d41e8f96929.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Boots Famiglia  Pashet - The Stern Puss in Boots\" width=776 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/920efb2e23573e26fb8a8b08a7339d65.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Sherwood Clinic  Robin Hood - The Haunted Doctor\" width=776 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/e481413fb17ccf3fb2faef9263aa74d3.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Oscar Wilde Salon  Manboy, Alfani, and Dorian Gray - The Men of the Night\" width=776 height=498 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/7aa73836d44a85bc978c778c2803d598.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Love Triangles To Navigate\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared for drama when you enter one of the Oz Famiglia's routes, because whoever's currently in second for your affection will continue vying for it! Will you stick your current partner, or will you fall their rival instead? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/a88f1dd25b05f9afb618a503344379ce.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Multiple Endings  There are many branching paths to explore, including 10 different character routes and over two dozen different endings! Plus a bonus ending when you unlock them all!\" width=780 height=549 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/32269a0778549a2f31fd72bab0c73919.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Renowned Voice Actors\" width=780 height=367 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the famous talent of actors like Shingaki Tarusuke (Nathaniel, <i>Bungo Stray Dogs</i>; Eishiro, <i>Prince of Tennis</i>), Okitsu Kazuyuki (Zantetsu, <i>Blue Lock</i>; Kotetsu, <i>Touken Ranbu</i>), Kakehashi Atsushi (Luthier, <i>Fire Emblem Heroes</i>, Laurus, <i>Galtia</i>), and many others as they woo your heart!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/d9b56a2745dd105015edffe90383315f.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Artwork By Satoi\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful, watercolor artwork from Satoi, the artist of <i>Diabolik Lovers</i>, <i>Norn 9</i>, and <i>Olympia Soirée</i>.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/249a008e95b42fc398ad3a04eea48f62.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"What If the Girl Who Walked the Yellow-Brick Road Never Decided There&#039;s No Place Like Home?\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking in a mysterious town without any memories, you quickly find yourself embroiled in the war between several mafia famiglia and sheltered by the Oz famiglia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you attempt to find your place in this town, several handsome men vie for your attention.<br><br>Who will you choose to trust? To love? Can you find a place to call your own? Can you bring peace to the town?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/8a425407fabefe9c55ca669244b48105.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/cdda1aa481f2abdd2a03c236b69effc8.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Loads Of Handsome Men Based On Fairytale Characters\" width=780 height=277 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/1cb6e20ce08ed2a4ec6a8365fde3a623.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Oz Famiglia  Caramia - The Courageous Lion  Kyrie - The Cunning Scarecrow  Axel - The Tin Man With A Heart Of Gold\" width=776 height=978 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303290/extras/27c06cefc95ff52a080e24f549bd5c87.avif?t=1785186377\" alt=\"Grimm Fami